<title>USA: Republic completes Continental merger.</title>
<headline>Republic completes Continental merger.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Republic Industries Inc said on Monday that it completed its previously announced merger with Continental Waste Industries Inc.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the transaction, Continental shareholders will receive eight-tenths of a share of Republic common stock for every Continental Waste share they own.</p>
<p>Effective Tuesday, Continental Waste will lose its listing on the Nasdaq, Republic said.</p>
<p>Carlos Aguero, Continental Waste's chief executive officer, and Thomas Volini, its chief operating officer, will join Republic's senior management, Republic said.</p>
</text>
